   ->  Vec Sort (actual rows=3.00 loops=1)
         Sort Key: a
         Bound: 3
         Columns: the keys and TIDs sorted, the rest fetched by TID
         Sort Method: top-N heapsort  Memory: 25kB
         ->  Vec Seq Scan on src (actual rows=1000.00 loops=1)
(7 rows)

