   Vector Quals: 2 of 2
   Kernel Steps: 3
   Fallback Steps: 0
   Row-by-Row Targets: 1
   Batches: 10
   Text Rows Converted: 126
   Source: vexec_test
   Text Columns Kept as Handed: 1
   Columns by Step: 1, 1
   Batches by Step: 10, 2
