   Output: s.a, s.c, d.tag
   Hash Cond: (s.a = d.k)
   Batch Format: postgres
   Kernel Steps: 0
   Fallback Steps: 0
   Batches: 1
   Hash Keys Compared As: integers
   Outer Input: batches
   Inner Input: batches
   Keys Lent to Outer Scan: range and bitmap
   Inner Rows: 25
   Memory Usage: 129 kB
   Rounds: 1
   ->  Vec Seq Scan on public.src s (actual rows=25.00 loops=1)
         Output: s.a, s.c
         Batch Format: postgres
         Kernel Steps: 0
         Fallback Steps: 0
         Batches: 1
         Source: vexec_test
         Rows Removed by Join Keys: 975
         Join Keys Given to Source: 1
         Join Keys Given: range and 25 values
   ->  Vec Seq Scan on public.srcj_dim d (actual rows=25.00 loops=1)
         Output: d.tag, d.k
         Filter: (d.tag = 'even'::text)
         Rows Removed by Filter: 29
         Batch Format: postgres
         Vector Quals: 1 of 1
         Kernel Steps: 1
         Fallback Steps: 0
         Batches: 1
         Source: vexec_test
         Columns by Step: 1, 1
         Batches by Step: 1, 1
(36 rows)

